              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Manase shiyayeelusia abomuBetsi sheani namataala kalio ta, kata abaTaanakhi na mataala kalio, kata abamenyanga muDori nama taala kalio, kata abamenyanga muIbileamu nama taala kalio, kata abamenyanga muMegido nama taala kalio ta; ne abaKanaani balumilila okhu menya mushialo eshio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
