        },
        {
          "text": "ne abaAmori balumilila okhumenya mushikulu shiaHeresi, nomuAiyaloni, nomuShaalibimu; nebutswa omukhono kweinzu yaYusufu nikubasitohela, nabo nibalunyibwa nibakholwa abasumba. ",
          "type": "text",
